{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"```verilog\nmodule phase_snapshot (\n    input  wire       clk,\n    input  wire       rst_n,\n    input  wire       capture,\n    input  wire       clear_sample,\n    input  wire [1:0] data,\n    input  wire       publish,\n    output reg  [1:0] sampled,\n    output reg  [1:0] visible,\n    output reg        published\n);\n\nalways @(negedge clk or negedge rst_n) begin\n    if (!rst_n)\n        sampled <= 2'b00;\n    else if (clear_sample)\n        sampled <= 2'b00;\n    else if (capture)\n        sampled <= data;\nend\n\nalways @(posedge clk or negedge rst_n) begin\n    if (!rst_n) begin\n        visible   <= 2'b00;\n        published <= 1'b0;\n    end else begin\n        published <= publish;\n        if (publish)\n            visible <= sampled;\n    end\nend\n\nendmodule\n```"}}
